cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or model in your work, please cite this repository."
title: "MJ1 2RC EKF SOC Estimation"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Lu"
    given-names: "Jiaxing"

version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-27

repository-code: "https://github.com/jiaxingLu/MJ1_2RC_EKF_SOC_Estimation"
url: "https://github.com/jiaxingLu/MJ1_2RC_EKF_SOC_Estimation"

abstract: >-
  Experimentally parameterised SOC-dependent second-order Thevenin
  equivalent-circuit model and Extended Kalman Filter for lithium-ion battery
  State-of-Charge estimation. The implementation is based on LG INR18650 MJ1
  experimental data and includes MATLAB and Simulink validation against a
  held-out discharge segment.

keywords:
  - lithium-ion battery
  - state of charge
  - SOC estimation
  - extended Kalman filter
  - EKF
  - battery management system
  - equivalent circuit model
  - Thevenin model
  - MATLAB
  - Simulink
